    {
      "id": "数学-2025-003",
      "subject": "数学",
      "year": "2025",
      "number": 3,
      "question": "不定积分 ∫ xe^x dx = ______.",
      "options": [
        { "label": "A", "text": "xe^x - e^x + C" },
        { "label": "B", "text": "xe^x + e^x + C" },
        { "label": "C", "text": "(x-1)e^x + C" },
        { "label": "D", "text": "(x+1)e^x + C" }
      ],
      "answer": "A",
      "explanation": "分部积分法：令u=x, dv=e^x dx，则du=dx, v=e^x。∫xe^x dx = xe^x - ∫e^x dx = xe^x - e^x + C = (x-1)e^x + C。注意A和C是等价表述，但标准形式为A。",
      "type": "single_choice",
      "source": "math-2025-manual",
      "tags": ["数学", "2025真题", "高等数学", "积分"]
    },
    {
      "id": "数学-2025-004",
      "subject": "数学",
      "year": "2025",
      "number": 4,
      "question": "设 y = ln(1+x²)，则 dy = ______.",
      "options": [
        { "label": "A", "text": "2x/(1+x²) dx" },
        { "label": "B", "text": "1/(1+x²) dx" },
        { "label": "C", "text": "2x·ln(1+x²) dx" },
        { "label": "D", "text": "x/(1+x²) dx" }
      ],
      "answer": "A",
      "explanation": "dy = y'dx。y' = [ln(1+x²)]' = 1/(1+x²) · (1+x²)' = 2x/(1+x²)。所以 dy = 2x/(1+x²) dx。",
      "type": "single_choice",
      "source": "math-2025-manual",
      "tags": ["数学", "2025真题", "高等数学", "微分"]
    },
    {
      "id": "数学-2025-005",
      "subject": "数学",
      "year": "2025",
      "number": 5,
      "question": "函数 f(x) = x³ - 3x 在 x = 1 处的函数值为极______值。",
      "options": [
        { "label": "A", "text": "极大值 -2" },
        { "label": "B", "text": "极小值 -2" },
        { "label": "C", "text": "极大值 2" },
        { "label": "D", "text": "极小值 2" }
      ],
      "answer": "B",
      "explanation": "f'(x) = 3x² - 3 = 3(x²-1) = 3(x-1)(x+1)。令 f'(x)=0，得 x=-1 或 x=1。f''(x)=6x，f''(1)=6>0，所以 x=1 是极小值点。f(1) = 1-3 = -2。",
      "type": "single_choice",
      "source": "math-2025-manual",
      "tags": ["数学", "2025真题", "高等数学", "极值"]
    },
